SUMMARY:Christopher Nolan's "The Odyssey" Movie-Watch\, Dinner and Discuss
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\n"Sing through me\, Muses\; Sing
  about the complicated man of twist and turns\, driven time and again off 
 course..."\nWelcome👋🏼\, my name's Wayne Yoder and Look forward to en
 joying "The Odyssey" with you!\nMeet and Greet in cinema foyer (not the IM
 AX) at 2:15PM before 2:30PM movie\, followed by optional Dinner and Discus
 s @Fiorentino's🥙🍹\, 6PM.\nJust look for the Hawaiian shirt.🌺\nWhe
 ther life as a journey\, personal essence\, fate\, feminism\, the Divine\,
  or manifold enigmas of our humanity\, "The Odyssey" has it!..\nCome and s
 hare in the questions\, inspirations\, and perhaps instances that you find
  resonate with your life-experiences.🌌\n\nEach attendee responsible for
  their own ticket\, and can be purchased through the Fandango app or direc
 tly on Penn Cinemas website. Most of us getting seats nearest the center o
 f the theater (mine C7).\n\nAug 28th\, 2:30PM: Standard Showing\n"The Odys
 sey"@Penn Cinema/Lititz\n541 Airport Rd\, Lititz\, PA 17543\n\nAug 28th\, 
 6PM: Dinner and Discuss\n@Fiorentino's Italian Restaurant\n500 Airport Rd\
 , Lititz\, PA 17543\n\n~ Group Reservation under "Lancaster Freethought So
 ciety" for 6PM @Fiorentino's🇮🇹
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 316200425/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260820T172123Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260820T172123Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
