SUMMARY:August Movie Night!  Comedies!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThis month\, at members request
 s\, we will be showing comedy films! Options will include:\n\nThe Velocipa
 stor\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JppwKpfOgyo\n\nDogma\n-Tra
 iler- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-8UW-O-rhv0\n\nMonty Python's Life o
 f Brian\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GeKzBQnAq5I&t=28s\n\nMo
 nty Python's Meaning of Life\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=va
 bfV4HRvRY\n\nAnd many\, many more! Bring your own film selections and we m
 ay decide to show them!\n\nAdmission is Free! Bring as many family members
  and friends as you would like! Please RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)
 \, hang out and share your thoughts!\n\nSome drinks and snacks will be pro
 vided\, please do bring more to share!\nPizza will be ordered\, please do 
 chip in if you partake in delivered food!\n\nSaturday\, August 29th\, 6:00
 pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room Theater\n715 N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nW
 e can delay starting the movie to give people time to arrive\, but no late
 r than 6:30pm\, please try to arrive before then if you do not want to mis
 s any of the movie.\n\nPICTURED below is the main entrance\, the event spa
 ce is right up the stairs. On street parking should be available\, several
  public parking lots such as behind CVS are within a 2 blocks walk along H
 arrisburg Pike.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 315779943/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260721T211453Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260721T211453Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
